    "enUS": {
      "description": "Field duty papers?  What manner of nonsense is this, {name}?",
      "dialogue": {
        "32a098ea1dd2ca663456": "I take it you want those papers signed, $Gboy:girl;?",
        "9f9f94489a232e0035fc": "Yes, I suppose that little skirmish will pass as field duty nowadays. Take these back to Cenarion Hold, I'm sure they'll have a cushy job ready for you.$B$BOff you go!",
        "ee46b87ee6710449de07": "I take it you want those papers signed, $Gboy:girl;?"
